HEARING HARDING

I was a tough cookie ... Now I'm a lady.  I hope people can finally see
me for who I am.  I've never been a bad girl.  Just because I like to
hunt and fish and ride a dirt bike doesn't make me a bad girl.  I was
young and naive, and I made some bad choices.  Who hasn't?  (Tonya
Harding, in TV Guide)

ShopTalk, December 20, 1999 <shoptalk@listserv.syr.edu>
